ZTČ-009 — Zjednodušená technická čeština

ZTČ-009 is an independent Czech controlled language. It uses the structure,
rule numbering and numeric limits of ASD-STE100 Simplified Technical English,
Issue 9 (2025-01-15).

All rule texts, explanations, examples and dictionary entries in this
repository are original work. This repository does not contain or translate
text from the ASD-STE100 document.

